(text "4Gb x16 + 4Gb x16 = 1 GiB. 1.5V only.\nInitial boot target: DDR3 1560 MT/s (780 MHz); training configuration pending.\nRD grade supports up to 1866 MT/s. No A15 or second chip select is required.\nDQ/DM point-to-point; command and clock branch to both devices.\nDo not substitute DDR4/LPDDR pin-function names when routing." (at 15.24 251.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "757026a3-3a73-5351-bce4-4cdab525461f"))
)
